      "statement": "Unacceptable risk AI practices are prohibited and include: subliminal techniques causing harm; exploiting vulnerabilities due to age, disability, or social/economic situation; social scoring; predictive policing based on profiling; untargeted scraping of facial images; emotion inference in workplace/education; biometric categorization of sensitive characteristics; real-time remote biometric identification for law enforcement (with narrow exceptions).",
